{"id": "DeoVqf-G4tG", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "If an A.I. app is free… who's paying the bill? 🤔\n\nEvery question you ask runs on expensive GPUs in a data centre: electricity, chips, cooling. Every answer costs money.\n\nSo why free? Three reasons:\n1. Build the habit, then sell you a paid plan\n2. Investor money, ready to take losses to win the market\n3. Your data: many A.I. apps can use your chats to improve their models, unless you turn the setting off\n\nIn ChatGPT: Settings → Data controls → \"Improve the model for everyone\". Switch it off if you want.\n\nUse A.I. as much as you like. Just never paste passwords, bank details or office secrets into a chat. 🔒\n\nSend this to the friend who tells ChatGPT everything 😅\n\n#ai #chatgpt #privacy #datasafety #techinhindi", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792328403, "like_count": 10, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18141393712575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 60.634, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOpPphJcOqdypjTSMeZC6_tEK6PzR3qvZExlq8bnks7ulGjpejq7Y9ceBoE3dqG0wF_sa-iD2PukJFLCXvz3To7ortNoin_yAGYxFg.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=AdoaBi0gWgZil1zZkK5sntgK7Rgs3inXjJGiHUZWZ37Wnhp3RAkfiiOR8z45tsMYKnmYH1ANvcDCqgo0_khZR454&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=6K2d2OdaJG4Q7kNvwEle9LT&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=W7VkxQFTF50JL-R0A5a6YA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTABaUDLNEFPb1vgGbazqpd_nzKbdFWmxwHdsa33UW1zg&oe=6AF41AFC", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 60.634, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKi